WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:07.005
Three letters. A changing tide. No clock. No rush.

2
00:00:07.046 --> 00:00:14.051
Take the bridge to Tern House. One letter delivered. The tide rises.

3
00:00:14.087 --> 00:00:22.093
Rising tide runs the ferry to Bell Tower. Two letters delivered.

4
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:30.125
High tide closes the causeway. Trying it costs no turns.

5
00:00:30.151 --> 00:00:38.157
Wait one turn. Falling tide opens the way to Gull Cottage.

6
00:00:38.181 --> 00:00:45.186
Cross the causeway. All three letters delivered. Time to go home.

7
00:00:45.551 --> 00:00:54.558
Home in five turns. Your real route becomes a keepsake postcard.

8
00:00:54.588 --> 00:00:58.590
Keep the postcard as an SVG, or replay the route one step at a time.

9
00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:06.734
Six little rounds. Unlimited undo. Your next delivery is waiting.
